        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "paw_print",
            "content": "<p>Brush pet’s coat to loosen debris and tangles. Wet them with lukewarm water. </p><p>Apply shampoo and then massage into a lather. </p><p>Let suds sit for a few minutes for thicker coats or as needed. </p><p>Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water until no more suds appear on hands or in pet’s coat. </p><p>Condition with our Pet Conditioner. </p><p>Gently dry pet in a towel. </p><p>This product is 100% biodegradable, septic & greywater-safe. Caution: Keep out of eyes, ears, and mouth. Avoid ingestion. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-purity water, cocamidopropyl hydroxysultaine, sodium C14-C16 olefin sulfonate, cocamidopropyl betaine, vegetable glycerin (glycerin), coco-glucoside, caprylyl capryl glucoside, polysorbate 20 (food grade), sodium chloride, sodium benzoate, potassium sorbate, caprylyl glycol, phenoxyethanol, citric acid</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><strong>Wild Heart (pet-safe scent): </strong>Essential Oil & Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil (linalyl acetate, linalool, limonene, benzyl benzoate, hexyl cinnamal, benzyl salicylate, coumarin, eugenol, vanillin, acetyl cedrene)</p><p><em>Unlike most fragrance oils, Rustic Strength’s oils are 100% certified free of the 624 carcinogens and 323 reproductive/developmental toxins listed under </em><a href=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\"><em>California’s Prop 65 act</em></a><em>.</em></p><p><strong>Unscented: No scent added</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xnzCmi": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Derived from vegetables. It is biodegradable and helps the plant surfactants do their job. Food-grade & USP kosher)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco- Glucoside</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and<br/>safe for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Plant-based surfactant that helps stabilize the formula when<br/>adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable. Kosher.<br/>Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free)</em></p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-chloride\" title=\"What is Sodium Chloride and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Chloride</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Salt)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate & Potassium Sorbate (</strong>Food-grade preservatives that are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in the container)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol & </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Safe preservatives which are used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Ece6Va": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul><p><strong>Retail Ready Case (2 oz, 4 oz & 16 oz) : </strong>Retail Ready products come as shown in the case image. Pump, Sprayer or Flip-Top Cap is included if shown.</p><p>No pump is available for the <strong>24 oz Glass Jug</strong>. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
